{"id":"method-piecewise-modeling","html":"<section class=\"contract\" id=\"contract\"><h2>什么时候用</h2><dl><dt>适合什么题</dt><dd>原题明确给出的超出部分阶梯单价、分界点和单位。</dd><dt>最后要得到什么</dt><dd>带完整用量区间与单位的分段费用关系式。</dd><dt>要注意</dt><dd>首批支持三档电价、正有理单价、递增正分界点和非负连续用量；不含全量重定价、附加费、取整或最低消费。</dd></dl></section><section id=\"path\"><h2>解题步骤</h2><p class=\"muted\">按顺序做。标了条件的技能，只在题目符合那个条件时才用。</p><ol class=\"method-path\" aria-label=\"解题步骤\"><li id=\"build\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><h3>逐档累计费用</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#build\" aria-label=\"定位到逐档累计费用\">#</a></div><p>按用量分档；先算前档费用，再算本档新增用量费用，最后相加。</p></li><li id=\"verify\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><h3>汇总并核对边界</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#verify\" aria-label=\"定位到汇总并核对边界\">#</a></div><p>写出分段关系式，代入零用量与两个分界点核验。</p></li></ol></section><section id=\"examples\"><h2>例题</h2><article class=\"example\"><h3>1. 阶梯电价</h3><p class=\"problem\">超过180千瓦时的部分按0.65元计费，前180千瓦时每度0.6元。第二档如何计费？</p><ol><li><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>180</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.65</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>180</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.65</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=0.6\\times180+0.65(x-180)=0.65x-9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.65</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.65</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span>。</span></li></ol><p class=\"source\">高中数学一本通·必修一（RJA版）第100页例12</p></article></section>"}
